                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Reading suggestion: \"The Dark Angel\" and \"The Wanderer\", both by Mika Waltari. Both take place in the same Constantinople around the same time period as the game +- a few decades. Playing AC Revelations is great way to visualize the books.\nWhat an ending to Altair's and Ezio's sagas, the way they are weaved together. When the two finally met was so well done it gave me chills.\nThey even taught new tricks to the old dog with the hookblade, which makes it's only appearance in the franchise.\n\n\nLukusuositus: Mika Waltarin Johannes Angelos sekä Mikael Hakim. Molemmat sijoittuvat samaan Konstantinopoliin suunnilleen samoihin aikoihin pelin kanssa plus-miinus muutama vuosikymmen.",
